  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Hello! I am Leo. Look at my clothes. I have a big red hat. Is it a good hat? Yes, it is! I wear it at school.",
      "I have blue jeans. Are they small? No, they are big. I have a yellow jacket. It is not new. It is a good jacket.",
      "Now look at my toys. I have a gray plane. It is small. I have a black motorbike. Is it big? Yes, it is! I like my things. Do you like them?"
    ],
